    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Portability-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom Sim Portability Batch Insertion API enables businesses to efficiently submit multiple requests for SIM portability in a single operation. This API is designed for telecom service providers looking to streamline the process of porting in customers from other networks. By utilizing this endpoint, providers can manage bulk operations and enhance customer experience through timely activation of SIMs. Typical consumers include telecom operators, customer service systems, and integration platforms requiring high-volume SIM management capabilities.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
